title: "aria-teleop: robot arm teleoperation with Meta Aria Gen 2 glasses"
abstract: >-
  Teleoperates a Trossen WidowX AI arm, in MuJoCo or on hardware, from the on-device hand tracking,
  head pose and eye tracking of Meta Aria Gen 2 glasses, with an eye-gesture clutch.
